RESPONSE {"aiReply":"### Non-O Visa Overview\nThe **Non-O Visa** is a great option if you're looking to stay in Thailand for extended periods. It\u2019s primarily for retirees, spouses of Thai nationals, or individuals seeking to visit family.\n\n### Eligibility Criteria\n- **Age**: Generally, you need to be **over 50 years old** to apply as a retiree.\n- **Duration**: This visa is typically valid for **90 days** initially, but can be extended up to **1 year**.\n\n### Conditions\n- You'll need to provide proof of financial stability, such as a bank statement showing a minimum balance or proof of income.\n- If applying as a spouse, documentation proving your relationship is required.\n\nDoes this sound like what you were looking for? If you have more specific questions or want to explore other options, just let me know! \ud83d\ude0a"}

